"The Ama-gi is an ancient Sumerian cuneiform word meaning 'freedom'. It is believed to be the first instance of humans writing that concept down. The Ama-gi symbol is popular with anarcho-capitalists." -- Vroman

http://billstclair.com/Amagi.png

Here's an alternative rendering from [[Matt Apple]]:

http://billstclair.com/ama-gi-icon-cropped.png

<b>Commentary from [[Russell Whitaker]]</b>:

The Ama-gi characters have been used for decades by [http://www.libertyfund.org/ The Liberty Fund Inc.] as the design motif for the endpapers of books in the LibertyClassics publishing imprint.
